5,1,1,talk,May,,"Alright everyone, let's figure this out! It's about time we stopped just winging it with the break room. I want to make sure we're being fair about how it's actually being used. What do you all think?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. It's become too cluttered to serve multiple purposes. We should look at the actual usage and the physical state of the room before deciding.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to see us all gathered to find a harmonious solution. Let us look toward the truth of the situation with open minds and a spirit of cooperation.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! A big meeting! I'm so excited to help! Let's make it a room that's super fun for everyone! I wonder what's actually going on in there? Let's find some clues!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm in! Let's make it a place where we can actually hang out and talk. I want to know how we've been using it and if it's actually helping us connect!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"Since we're looking for clues, I'll start by checking the ""Fortnight's tally of use by person"" and ""Crumbs and bins at the desks."" Let's see who's actually in there and who's leaving a mess!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I'll look into ""The partition wall to the office"" and ""Crumbs and bins at the desks."" I want to see if the noise and the mess are as bad as they seem.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"To ensure we are not placing an undue burden on anyone's time, I shall look into the ""Invoices for outside hire by the hour"" and the ""Facilities callouts on this floor."" Balance is key to longevity.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"I want to see the money stuff too! I'll check ""Invoices for outside hire by the hour"" and ""Quotes for the two fit-outs."" Let's see how much these things actually cost!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'll check ""Unplanned talk since the refit"" and ""Where the last awkward conversation happened."" I want to see if we're actually talking to each other or just avoiding the hard stuff!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,"I think we've covered the basics! It'll be interesting to see if the data matches our feelings. @Misaki, you're also checking the crumbs—let's compare notes later and see who the real culprit is!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,That sounds fine. I'm less interested in finding a culprit and more interested in whether the current setup is sustainable for those of us working nearby.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, and I believe our findings will guide us. Let us remember that the goal is not to assign blame, but to create a space where everyone can flourish.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I agree with Servas! No blaming allowed! But I still want to see those big numbers. It'll be like a treasure hunt for the truth! I can't wait to see what we find!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm with Sakura! Let's keep it positive. I just hope we find out that we can use the room to be more honest with each other. I'm really looking forward to seeing those results!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,"I'm always for positivity, but a little accountability makes things more fun, right? Let's just get the facts first. I'm ready to see what the data says!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
