65,3,1,talk,May,,"Looking at the options, C is the only one that actually solves my problem. A shared calendar means no more ""first come, first served"" chaos, and it stops the room from being a private club for two!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Option C is the most logical choice. It addresses the need for a structured system and, combined with the fit-out, provides a dedicated space for discussions that currently leak into the office.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Option C offers a balanced path. By formalizing the space for meetings, we reduce the need for outside travel and rentals, thereby reclaiming the precious hours we have been wasting. It is a sustainable choice.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"I'm voting for C too! It's the one that saves us from spending all that money on outside rooms. Plus, a big screen sounds so cool! Let's make it a super-duper meeting spot!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm definitely voting for C! It's the only way we can have those important, private talks without everyone hearing. Let's finally stop being strangers and start talking to each other in our own space!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,2,talk,May,,"It seems we're all in agreement for once! I'll happily support Option C, as long as we actually stick to that calendar and don't let the ""first come, first served"" habit creep back in.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"As long as the fit-out includes the necessary improvements to the environment, I am satisfied. A structured system for booking will also help manage the flow of people and reduce the noise levels in the main office.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,2,talk,Servas,,"When we align our intentions with a clear structure, the burden of maintenance becomes a shared joy rather than a chore. Option C is a wise investment in our collective time and peace.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,2,talk,Sakura,,Yay! Everyone agrees! It's like a magic trick where we all want the same thing! I'm so happy we're getting the cool screen and saving all that money. This is the best meeting ever!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,2,talk,Kenji,,I'm so glad we're all on the same page! Let's use this new space to really get to know each other and be honest. I can't wait for us to actually feel like a team!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,3,talk,May,,"Since we're all on the same page, let's just make it official. I'm voting for Option C. Let's just make sure that ""shared calendar"" actually means something!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"I vote for Option C. It is the most practical solution to the issues we have discussed, provided the implementation actually addresses the sound leakage and usage fairness.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,3,talk,Servas,,"I cast my vote for Option C. By bringing our gatherings home, we honor our time and energy, ensuring that no one is burdened by unnecessary travel or hidden costs. It is a most harmonious choice.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,3,talk,Sakura,,I vote for Option C! It's the best way to save money and get a cool new room! I'm so excited to see the screen! Yay!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I vote for Option C! Let's make it a place where we can finally talk openly and get closer as a team. I'm so happy we decided this together!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
